 datasets, parliamentary material, regulator data, or clearly named public reports. Nationality, foreign-born status, asylum status, immigration status, charge, suspect, conviction, and victim categories must not be mixed.</p></article><article class="card"><span class="label">Document trail</span><h3>Open the underlying record</h3><p>When the figure matters, follow the document link, source file, court record, official release, PDF, book, or video. The visible page should help readers reach the underlying evidence fast.</p></article></div></section><script type="application/json" id="compatibility-marker-vault" data-cleanup-marker="deep-cleanup">{"status":"compatibility-routes-preserved-with-clean-public-copy","checked":"2026-07-01","routes":["downloads/forum-posts.json","downloads/forum-posts.md","feed-center.html","share-center.html","launch-room.html","offer-center.html","source-document-vault.html","evidence-vault.html","black-file.html"]}</script></main><footer class="footer wrap"><p><strong>MATRIX REPROGRAMMED</strong> — feed the trackers, pull the records, upgrade only what the evidence supports.</p><p class="warning">This feed tracks public-record accountability lanes. It is not a verdict page.</p></footer></div><script src="matrix.js"></script><script>function el(t,c,x){const n=document.createElement(t);if(c)n.className=c;if(x!==undefined)n.textContent=x;return n}function p(parent,label,text){const x=el('p');x.appendChild(el('strong','',label));x.appendChild(document.createTextNode(' '+String(text||'')));parent.appendChild(x)}function list(parent,title,items){const c=el('article','card');c.appendChild(el('h3','',title));const ul=el('ul');(items||[]).forEach(i=>ul.appendChild(el('li','',typeof i==='string'?i:(i.label||JSON.stringify(i)))));c.appendChild(ul);parent.appendChild(c)}function lane(parent,x){const c=el('article','card redline');c.appendChild(el('span','label',x.id||''));c.appendChild(el('h3','',x.title||''));p(c,'Purpose:',x.purpose);parent.appen